<title>FINLAND: CAR FERRY SEAWIND AGROUND OFF STOCKHOLM - AGENCY.</title>
<headline>CAR FERRY SEAWIND AGROUND OFF STOCKHOLM - AGENCY.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Car ferry Seawind ran aground off the coast of Sweden in the Stockholm early on Wednesday and its 134 passengers were being evacuated, Finnish news agency STT said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The ferry had departed from Turku, STT said.</p>
<p>The situation was reported to be under control, STT said.</p>
</text>
